  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ABC Impact Fund II LP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ABC Impact II is a private equity impact fund established in Singapore with a target capitalization of $700 million. The Fund aims to provide growth capital to viable innovative business models that advance the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) in Asia, while seeking commensurate risk-adjusted financial returns. It will invest across four thematic sectors: better health care and education, financial and digital inclusion, sustainable food and agriculture, and climate and water solutions, with a particular focus on the People&apos;s Republic of China (PRC), India, Indonesia, Malaysia, the Philippines, Thailand, and Viet Nam.</narrative>
  </description>
